# Arike Recipe App Configuration
# 
# This app works out-of-the-box with built-in recipe data (27 recipes).
# No environment variables are required for testing and development.
#
# OPTIONAL: Supabase Backend Integration (for future scalability)
# If you want to use Supabase to store recipes in the cloud instead of locally,
# uncomment the lines below and provide your Supabase credentials:
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your_supabase_url_here
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_key_here
#
# Get these values from your Supabase project settings (Project Settings > API)
# Example format:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

